---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<section id="acogida" class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    <!-- Left Column: Inspiring Imagery with Sacred Frame -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sacred border border-surface-container aspect-[4/5] bg-surface-container-high">
        <img 
          src="/images/community.png" 
          alt="Comunidad parroquial acogedora" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
        
        <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white">
          <p class="font-serif italic text-lg text-gold-accent mb-1">
            "Donde dos o tres están reunidos en mi nombre..."
          </p>
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 font-semibold">
            San Mateo 18, 20
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Accent Decorative Box -->
      <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 hidden sm:flex flex-col bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gold/30 max-w-[220px]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-1">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Puertas Abiertas</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted leading-tight">
          No importa cuánto tiempo lleves alejado, este siempre es tu hogar de fe.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Welcome Vision & What to Expect -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
        </svg>
        <span>¿Tu primera vez en la parroquia?</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-charcoal font-bold leading-tight">
        Una Comunidad Cálida Donde Cada Persona Tiene un Lugar
      </h2>

      <p class="text-charcoal-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
        Somos una familia de creyentes, peregrinos y buscadores. Si estás de paso en el barrio, si buscas bautizar a tu hijo o simplemente anhelas un rato de paz en medio del ajetreo urbano, queremos que te sientas plenamente recibido.
      </p>

      <!-- What to Expect / Pillars Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-4 rounded-xl border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal">Ambiente Cercano</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-1 leading-snug">
              Sin formalismos rígidos; nos importa tu corazón, no cómo vengas vestido.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-4 rounded-xl border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-gold/15 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal">Atención a Niños y Familias</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-1 leading-snug">
              Misa especial dominical a las 10:30 h con catequesis adaptada y cantos alegres.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-4 rounded-xl border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-navy/10 text-navy flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal">Acompañamiento Espiritual</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-1 leading-snug">
              Sacerdotes siempre disponibles para escuchar tus inquietudes y bendecir tu camino.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-4 rounded-xl border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal">Caridad Solidaria</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-1 leading-snug">
              Comedor, ropero y banco de alimentos en acción permanente en el barrio.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Button -->
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a 
          href={`https://wa.me/${siteConfig.contact.whatsappNumber}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hola padre, soy nuevo en la parroquia y me gustaría conocer la comunidad...')}`}
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-md bg-navy text-white hover:bg-navy-hover font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Escribir al Despacho Parroquial</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
